1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,407
Speaking, task three. Story number 4: The lost wallet. What happened to Mr Dvořák yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,205
What happened to Mr Dvořák yesterday?

3
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:41,166
Yesterday morning Mr Dvořák took the bus to work.

4
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:43,856
The bus was very crowded.

5
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:50,423
When he got to work he wanted to buy a coffee, but found that his wallet was gone.

6
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:58,661
He was nervous because his bank card, driving licence and residence permit were in the wallet.

7
00:00:58,867 --> 00:01:02,833
First he called the bank and blocked the card.

8
00:01:03,033 --> 00:01:07,767
In the afternoon he went to the police and reported the lost documents.

9
00:01:07,967 --> 00:01:10,700
The police officer wrote a report.

10
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:17,163
In the evening the transport company called him: someone had found the wallet on the bus.

11
00:01:17,367 --> 00:01:27,902
Tell story 4 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
